  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Vg7xUZU.png\" width=\"472\" height=\"156\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-Only-d9aa6b?style=for-the-badge&logo=condaforge&logoColor=d9aa6b&labelColor=26303d\" alt=\"\" width=\"140\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Requires-Upgraded Netherite-F16436?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=FFFFFF&labelColor=1C1C1C\" width=\"280\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-ultimerite/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:70886\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.16.x-Maintenance-yellow?style=plastic\" alt=\"\" width=\"124\" height=\"18\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-ultimerite/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:73242\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.17.x-Unsupported-red?style=plastic\" alt=\"\" width=\"126\" height=\"18\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-ultimerite/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:73250\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.18.x-Maintenance-yellow?style=plastic\" width=\"124\" height=\"18\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-ultimerite/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:73407\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.19.x-Active Development-green?style=plastic\" width=\"166\" height=\"18\"></a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">请使用 CurseForge 下载，请勿重新托管文件。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">本模组可用于任何整合包。（仅限 CurseForge）</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">目前暂无 Fabric 版本计划，敬请谅解。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">致一直询问铲镐的玩家 ➜</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\">Upgraded Tools</a></span></strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">Spartan Weaponry 扩展模组 ➜</span><span style=\"color:#36f\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-spartan-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Upgraded Netherite : Spartan Weaponry</a></span></strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">提供替代材质包 ➜</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/upgraded-netherite-alternative\" rel=\"nofollow\">Upgraded Netherite : Alternative</a></span></strong><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;（已更新！）</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>简介</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">新增 Ultimerite 护甲、马铠、武器与工具。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/650/ultimeriteingot.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/651/output_qajrzi.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"61\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">1.19 :</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/652/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"></span></strong>&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/653/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"></span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">效果</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Ultimerite</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>护甲与马铠</strong></em> ：继承其他护甲的效果。（可配置）</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>武器与工具</strong></em> ：继承其他武器和工具的效果。（可配置）</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">在合成台中将其与其他组件组合，即可禁用或启用其他护甲、武器和工具的效果。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>金锭</em></strong> 赋予 <strong><em>Golderite</em></strong> 效果。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>烈焰棒</em></strong> 赋予 <strong><em>Blazerite</em></strong> 效果。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>末影珍珠</em></strong> 赋予 <strong><em>Enderite</em></strong> 效果。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>海晶砂粒</em></strong> 赋予 <strong><em>Prismarite</em></strong> 效果。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>凋零骷髅头颅</em></strong> 赋予 <strong><em>Witherite</em></strong> 效果。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>蜘蛛眼</em></strong> 赋予 <strong><em>Spiderite</em></strong> 效果。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>幻翼膜</em></strong> 赋予 <strong><em>Phanterite</em></strong> 效果。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>羽毛</em></strong> 赋予 <strong><em>Featherite</em></strong> 效果。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>配置文件</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">客户端</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><code>upgradednetherite_ultimate-client.toml</code> 位于 <code>/config</code> 目录下</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">服务端</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><code>upgradednetherite_ultimate-server.toml</code> 位于 <code>/saves/WORLD_NAME/serverconfigs</code> 目录下</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">将此文件复制到 <code>/defaultconfigs</code> 文件夹后，该配置将应用于所有新建的世界。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">专用服务器中，此文件位于 <code>/world/serverconfigs</code> 目录下</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>我的其他模组</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">1.20 及以上版本</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/DDjo2cf.png\" width=\"262\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/jTc5hni.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-additional-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/oC1EQZw.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"78\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-totems\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/W7CebyS.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/n9kZnB2.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-gear-expansion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/utZxZ4t.png\" width=\"270\" height=\"62\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">旧版</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VV3KsKX.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iAwAGmm.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-spartan-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QL8sbmz.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-creativerite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2lTS4p1.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-aetherite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g7c0DLT.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>",
